   <|"Data" -> "This is basically a continuous transformation from a circle \
to a square without invoking infinity. You can pick your own \
squircle!\n\n\n\n", "Display" -> "markdown", 
    "Hash" -> "58f82755-6bba-4e85-b68f-438c7a760dfc", "Invisible" -> False, 
